#: ../../../power/runtime_pm:322: ../drivers/base/power/runtime.c:168
msgid ""
"Compute the autosuspend-delay expiration time based on the device's "
"power.last_busy time.  If the delay has already expired or is disabled "
"(negative) or the power.use_autosuspend flag isn't set, return 0. Otherwise "
"return the expiration time in nanoseconds."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../power/runtime_pm:322: ../drivers/base/power/runtime.c:173
msgid ""
"This function may be called either with or without dev->power.lock held. "
"Either way it can be racy, since power.last_busy may be updated at any time."
msgstr ""

